# Courseware: source PDFs and the extract/embed caches stay local. The built
# index AND the per-source shards are committed -- shards are what make adding
# book #2 re-embed only book #2 on a fresh clone. Re-fetch source PDFs from the
# `url` recorded in courseware/manifest.yaml.
courseware/sources/
courseware/index/cache/
